library "Breast Cancer Neoadjuvant".
terminology "Invasive Breast Carcinoma":
- system is `https://reason-healthcare.github.io/hl7-agentic-knowledge-connectathon/fhir/CodeSystem/breast-cancer-fixture`.
- code is `invasive-breast-carcinoma` display is `Invasive breast carcinoma (fixture assertion)`.
concept "Diagnosis Records": - shape is RecordSet. - type is Condition. - coded from "Invasive Breast Carcinoma".
concept "Active Breast Cancer": - shape is RecordSet. - type is Condition. - definition is "Diagnosis Records" active.
concept "Indexed Breast Cancer": - shape is RecordSet. - type is Condition. - definition is "Active Breast Cancer" verified.
concept "Has Active Confirmed Invasive Breast Cancer": - type is Observation. - value type is boolean. - defined as exists ( "Indexed Breast Cancer" ).
