// Preserve the selected coded result. Only definitive receptor results enter
// the positive/negative assessment; equivocal is unresolved, not a negative.
concept "HER2 Result Is Definitive":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is "HER2 Result" in "Definitive Receptor Results".
- shape reduction is most recent.

criterion "Has Nonmetastatic Disease": - when ("Nonmetastatic Disease Result").
criterion "Has Clinically Positive Nodes": - when ("Clinically Positive Nodes Result").
criterion "Has Clinical T1c Or Higher": - when ("Clinical T1c Or Higher Result").

criterion "In Neoadjuvant Review Population": - when ("Has Active Confirmed Invasive Breast Cancer" and "Has Nonmetastatic Disease").
criterion "Is Triple Negative": - when ("Estrogen Receptor Negative" and "Progesterone Receptor Negative" and "HER2 Negative").
criterion "Meets Tumor Or Node Criterion": - when ("Has Clinical T1c Or Higher" or "Has Clinically Positive Nodes").
criterion "Neoadjuvant TNBC Guidance Applicable": - when ("In Neoadjuvant Review Population" and "Is Triple Negative" and "Meets Tumor Or Node Criterion").
activity "Oncology Review Guidance":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `The documented nonmetastatic triple-negative breast cancer with clinically positive nodes or at least clinical T1c disease meets the supplied neoadjuvant guidance criterion for oncology review. This does not establish chemotherapy fitness or authorize a medication order. The ASCO 2022 immunotherapy update concerns a distinct high-risk population; this review trigger does not determine pembrolizumab eligibility.`.
activity "Nothing Recommended":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Nothing recommended by this neoadjuvant TNBC review rule. Its applicability criteria are not met. This does not mean that cancer treatment or other oncology review is unnecessary.`.

decision "Neoadjuvant Guidance":
first:
- when "In Neoadjuvant Review Population" then:
  - when "HER2 Result Is Definitive" then:
    first:
    - when ("Is Triple Negative" and "Meets Tumor Or Node Criterion") then recommend activity "Oncology Review Guidance".
    - otherwise then recommend activity "Nothing Recommended".
  end.
end.
- otherwise then recommend activity "Nothing Recommended".

presentation for "Estrogen Receptor Result":
- question text is "What is the estrogen receptor (ER) result?".

presentation for "Progesterone Receptor Result":
- question text is "What is the progesterone receptor (PR) result?".

presentation for "HER2 Result":
- question text is "What is the HER2 result?".

presentation for "Clinical M Result":
